OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands fuel prices set to
OL,4,Arise again
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the war still ongoing in the
OL,7,FMiddle East, fuel prices have increased
OL,8,Facross the UK, with diesel prices
OL,9,Fhitting an all-time high, according to
OL,10,Fthe RAC motoring organisation.
